<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean flour firms seek 23,000T of wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean flour firms seek 23,000T of wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd and Cheiljedang Corp on Wednesday invited tenders for a combined total of 23,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT), traders said.  </p>
<p>Out of the total, Cheiljedang invited tenders for 10,000 tonnes at basis over December futures on the Chicago Board of Trade, they said.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for November 25-December 25 to the southeastern port cities of Pusan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
